@DISTRO_NAME@ — an overlay distribution on unmodified NetBSD base.

@MOTD@

  * Built with the stock NetBSD tooling: no patched src/, no patched pkgsrc.
  * Third-party software comes from pkgsrc; the base system is the real thing.
  * The root filesystem is FFS; ZFS is available for data pools only.

  Docs:    @BRAND_URL@

  Try:  pkg_add -u bash     # update a package
        zpool list          # the ZFS data pools of this system
